<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan tenders to buy jet fuel for Oct 10-20.</title>
<headline>Taiwan tenders to buy jet fuel for Oct 10-20.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has issued a tender to buy 32,000 tonnes of jet fuel for October 10-20 delivery on a cost-and-freight (c-and-f) basis to Keelung or Shen Ao, a CPC official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on September 4 and offers will be valid until September 6.</p>
<p>In its last tender, CPC bought 32,000 tonnes of jet fuel around $228 per tonne for September 20-30 delivery, c-and-f Keelung or Shen Ao.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (+65-8703084)</p>
</text>
